{"articleNo":"101700","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=101700&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"구미지역 통학버스 운행시간 조정 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2014.02.25","hit":"4884","attachments":[{"name":"구미지역통학버스(2014. 3. 3.).xls","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=101700&attachNo=72348"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;2014학년도 1학기 개강에 따라 구미지역 통학버스 학기중 운행시간을 붙임과 같이 조정</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">하여 안내하오니 이용에 착오 없으시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 1. 시행기간 : </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">2014. 3. 3.(월)부터 추후 운행시간 조정시 까지</span></u></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 단, 공휴일 및 휴무일은 운행하지 않음</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 2. 조정사유 : 신평캠퍼스 학과 이전에 따른 차량 운행</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 3. 조정내용 : 오태상모 노선에 신평캠퍼스 후문 노선 추가운영 및 시간 조정</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 4. 하교시 학교 출발장소 : 다목적운동장 뒤편 버스주차장(그린에너지관 서편)</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 5. 양호캠퍼스와 신평캠퍼스간 일과 중 셔틀버스 운행시간표는 추후 공지함</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"></p><p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">붙임 구미지역 통학버스 운행노선 및 시간표 1부. 끝.</span></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
